    <string name="support_faq_assistant_a">Tap the assistant bubble over the map and ask which bus to take or how to get somewhere. You need to be signed in.</string>
    <string name="support_faq_arrival_q">How do I turn on the drop-off alert?</string>
    <string name="support_faq_arrival_a">Pick a route on the map, tap Turn on in the arrival alert and mark where you get off. In Settings you choose how far ahead it warns you and whether it vibrates or rings.</string>
    <string name="support_faq_location_q">Why doesn\'t the map show where I am?</string>
    <string name="support_faq_location_a">Check that the app has location permission and that GPS is on. The app works without location, but it can\'t centre the map on you.</string>
